<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποβᾰ-τήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, of Zeus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>as protector of persons landing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.11.7
			</span></i>; of Artemis, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.1539
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Erythrae</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>) <i>offerings made on landing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βουθρωτός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.200
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τόπος</span> place <i>of
			landing,</i> of Mt. Ararat, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				1.3.5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
